  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "EditorVectorGizmoComponent provides an interactive UI gizmo rendered on an HTML Canvas for manipulating 3D vector properties (X, Y, Z) within an editor inspector. It supports two interaction modes: 'trackball' for X/Y manipulation via mouse drag, and 'roll' for Z rotation based on mouse angle change. The component translates raw mouse events into structured data changes emitted via the valueChange EventEmitter, acting as a presentation layer for data model updates."
  },
